plans.236c2fa199fb4b0b395092be80c8c879:
{"text":"The quiet is written down as a pause in spending. The Norway spring campaign started on 24 March 2026 and its ads stopped on 9 May 2026, when the regulator paused all price promotions in Norway [#r1.items.0.checked.date] [itm_eprlkrz2] [itm_za26xpzv]. The owner of Marketing says Norway campaigns were all price promotions, so no paid campaign has run there since [itm_za26xpzv].

