plans.fba5cd2a66cd6c6bb5692bde35050b43:
{"text":"The catch is that Sweden orders before 19 January 2026 are not reliable, because they come from the old payment report, which left out bank transfers. Use Sweden orders from 19 January 2026, and compare them only with later months [itm_r6lyl1pc]. So last autumn's Sweden orders are missing bank transfers and should not be compared with later months as they stand. The item says this is not a jump in January 2026; the report started counting bank transfers.

