plans.59588c88676756968590e6d48f89aa5e:
{"text":"Heed holds no decision on whether to bring the Norway campaigns back, and it cannot say whether they should return. What is written is that Marketing's Norway spring campaign ran from 24 March to 9 May 2026, and its ads stopped when the Norway regulator paused all price promotions on 9 May 2026, while it writes new pricing rules. The Marketing owner notes that the Norway campaigns were all price promotions, so no paid campaign has run there since, and that missing return on ad spend since May does not mean the campaigns failed [#r1.items.0.id] [#r1.items.2.id]. Those price promotions are the campaigns the regulator's pause affects.

